{"title": "Three buy signals, fast", "type": "Speed cheat sheet", "hooks": ["Three buy signals in thirty seconds. Learn them before your next trade.", "Three buy signals in thirty seconds. Only one paid off.", "Three bullish signals, three real charts, thirty seconds."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Three buy signals in thirty seconds. Learn them before your next trade.", "text": "3 buy signals. 30 seconds.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "1. Bullish engulfing", "show": 90, "vo": "One: bullish engulfing. A green body covers the whole red body before it. Ten candles later, 0.9 percent higher.", "cues": [{"say": "bullish engulfing", "do": "mark", "i": 90, "label": "1", "side": "high", "tone": "green"}, {"say": "Ten candles later", "do": "reveal", "to": 100}], "win": [20, 102]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 1, "head": "2. Uptrend", "show": 90, "vo": "Two: an uptrend. Higher highs and higher lows. But a trend lasts only until it stops. The next twenty-five candles fell 3.1 percent.", "cues": [{"say": "Higher highs", "do": "mark", "i": 58, "label": "HH", "side": "high", "tone": "green"}, {"say": "higher lows", "do": "mark", "i": 59, "label": "HL", "side": "low", "tone": "green"}, {"say": "fell 3.1 percent", "do": "reveal", "to": 115}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 2, "head": "3. Double bottom", "show": 90, "vo": "Three: a double bottom. Two lows at the same price. It only counts once a close breaks the high between them. This one broke down instead.", "cues": [{"say": "Two lows", "do": "mark", "i": 80, "label": "1", "side": "low", "tone": "teal"}, {"say": "the same price", "do": "mark", "i": 87, "label": "2", "side": "low", "tone": "teal"}, {"say": "broke down instead", "do": "reveal", "to": 96}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "big", "text": "A clue, never a promise", "vo": "Each one is a clue, never a promise. Wait for the close that confirms it.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Save this cheat sheet", "vo": "Save this, and practise spotting them at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "Three buy signals in thirty seconds.\n\nBullish engulfing: a green body covering the red one before it.\nUptrend: higher highs and higher lows, until it stops.\nDouble bottom: two equal lows, only complete on a close above the high between them.\n\nSave this for your next chart.\n\nPractise at memestreet.net\n\nFictional market. Not investment advice.\n\n#MemeStreet #Candlesticks #ChartPatterns #LearnToTrade", "charts": [{"candles": [[9.66, 9.66, 9.63, 9.63, 120339], [9.6, 9.68, 9.47, 9.54, 649686], [9.55, 9.6, 9.54, 9.58, 361420], [9.59, 9.61, 9.58, 9.6, 233033], [9.6, 9.62, 9.59, 9.62, 208332], [9.62, 9.62, 9.59, 9.59, 76693], [9.59, 9.6, 9.59, 9.59, 77876], [9.62, 9.64, 9.55, 9.59, 321392], [9.59, 9.6, 9.44, 9.47, 167813], [9.47, 9.52, 9.46, 9.52, 110201], [9.52, 9.57, 9.52, 9.55, 74216], [9.55, 9.56, 9.54, 9.55, 25170], [9.55, 9.57, 9.55, 9.57, 29491], [9.6, 9.64, 9.6, 9.63, 172996], [9.63, 9.64, 9.5, 9.52, 176308], [9.52, 9.53, 9.49, 9.5, 110219], [9.5, 9.53, 9.48, 9.51, 147350], [9.51, 9.52, 9.51, 9.51, 51851], [9.51, 9.51, 9.5, 9.5, 38416], [9.55, 9.58, 9.52, 9.56, 216433], [9.56, 9.57, 9.54, 9.55, 154868], [9.55, 9.56, 9.53, 9.55, 192846], [9.55, 9.57, 9.53, 9.55, 240861], [9.55, 9.56, 9.54, 9.54, 129885], [9.54, 9.55, 9.54, 9.55, 76223], [9.57, 9.6, 9.45, 9.48, 485488], [9.48, 9.49, 9.45, 9.46, 153123], [9.46, 9.52, 9.42, 9.46, 209862], [9.46, 9.53, 9.44, 9.5, 210614], [9.5, 9.52, 9.48, 9.51, 109653], [9.51, 9.54, 9.49, 9.5, 127187], [9.51, 9.68, 9.42, 9.51, 712858], [9.51, 9.62, 9.48, 9.54, 484776], [9.54, 9.57, 9.48, 9.52, 376727], [9.52, 9.54, 9.45, 9.47, 359567], [9.48, 9.49, 9.45, 9.49, 118080], [9.49, 9.51, 9.47, 9.48, 49337], [9.52, 9.53, 9.45, 9.51, 230722], [9.52, 9.56, 9.47, 9.56, 307820], [9.57, 9.84, 9.57, 9.79, 290156], [9.78, 9.8, 9.76, 9.76, 145316], [9.76, 9.77, 9.75, 9.76, 36722], [9.76, 9.76, 9.73, 9.73, 54558], [9.67, 9.74, 9.64, 9.73, 630163], [9.74, 9.81, 